{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14629","headline":"敬酬陆山人二首 二 · 戴叔伦","name":"敬酬陆山人二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"由来海畔逐樵渔，奉诏因乘使者车。\n却掌山中子男印，自看犹是旧潜夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}